What If All Continents Reunited? — flat-vector explainer (1080×1920, 24 fps)
Everything on screen is drawn in code (main.js + kit.js + geo.js, canvas 2D): Earth, the continents (rough hand-placed outlines,
not a real reconstruction), the Sun, the person, the car, ship, truck and train, the reptile, the cliffs, the mountains, the type. No images, no stock footage, no generated media. Our own character designs, in the
Beyond Everything brand style. Facts: the fact-check table in SCRIPT.md.

Type
  Nunito — the Nunito Project Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (fonts/OFL-Nunito.txt), from github.com/google/fonts.
Voice
  Microsoft Edge neural voice "Ryan" (en-GB-RyanNeural, +5%), via edge-tts
  (same voice as the earlier Beyond Everything films).
Score and sound effects
  Original, synthesized in music.py and mix.py (numpy/scipy). No samples.
